WEBVTT

00:35:29.072 --> 00:35:30.891
that has a slightly different culture.

00:35:30.915 --> 00:35:34.182
And so, they should be paying attention
to those needs that they have

00:35:34.206 --> 00:35:36.271
and then making the adjustments within.

00:35:36.295 --> 00:35:38.137
Or if they really love that lab, OK,

00:35:38.161 --> 00:35:40.878
well, how do you make this work
for your temperament?

00:35:40.902 --> 00:35:44.127
What could you be doing
to build stimulation into your workday?

00:35:44.151 --> 00:35:48.066
So you still get to do the work you love,
but you're honoring who you are.

00:35:48.090 --> 00:35:52.455
CA: Talk a bit about schools
and about parenting.

00:35:52.479 --> 00:35:56.401
What should schools do differently,
and what should parents know?

00:35:56.425 --> 00:35:58.907
SC: I think it starts with --

00:35:58.931 --> 00:36:03.727
this is going to sound very woo-woo
and loosey-goosey but it really matters --